  FT["MY-H2171"] = {"id":"MY-H2171","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 192/2013&status=CANCEL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2013年外汇管制（黄金豁免）（废止）令","en":"EXCHANGE CONTROL (GOLD EXEMPTION) (REVOCATION) ORDER 2013","orig":"EXCHANGE CONTROL (GOLD EXEMPTION) (REVOCATION) ORDER 2013","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát ngoại hối (Miễn trừ vàng) (Bãi bỏ) năm 2013","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมการแลกเปลี่ยนเงิน (การยกเว้นทองคำ) (การเพิกถอน) ค.ศ. 2013","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Devisa (Pembebasan Emas) (Pencabutan) Tahun 2013","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Pertukaran Wang (Pengecualian Emas) (Pembatalan) 2013"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA192","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2013","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2013_P.U.(A)192-2013_EXCHANGE CONTROL (GOLD EXEMPTION) (REVOCATION) ORDER 2013.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2171-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Pertukaran Wang\n(Pengecualian Emas) (Pembatalan) 2013.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 30 Jun 2013.\n\nPembatalan"}},{"id":"MY-H2171-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. Perintah Kawalan Pertukaran Wang (Pengecualian Emas) 1986\n[P.U. (A) 465/1986] dibatalkan.\n\nDibuat 27 Jun 2013\n[BNM/JUN/1120/05 /2; PN(PU2)206/III]\n\n                             TAN SRI DATO' SRI DR. ZETI AKHTAR AZIZ\n                                      Pengawal Pertukaran Wang Asing\n\nEXCHANGE CONTROL ACT 1953\n\nEXCHANGE CONTROL (GOLD EXEMPTION) (REVOCATION) ORDER 2013\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 34 of the Exchange Control Act 1953\n[Act 17], the Controller of Foreign Exchange makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-5"};
  FT["MY-H2172"] = {"id":"MY-H2172","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 192/2014&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2014年印刷机与出版物（不良出版物管制）（第6号）令","en":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 6) ORDER 2014","orig":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 6) ORDER 2014","ms":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Kawalan Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (Bilangan 6) 2014","vi":"Lệnh về Máy in và ấn phẩm (Kiểm soát ấn phẩm không mong muốn) (số 6) năm 2014","th":"คำสั่งแท่นพิมพ์และสิ่งพิมพ์ (การควบคุมสิ่งพิมพ์ที่ไม่พึงประสงค์) (ฉบับที่ 6) ค.ศ. 2014","id":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Pengendalian Terbitan Tidak Diinginkan) (Nomor 6) Tahun 2014"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA192","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2014","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2014_P.U.(A)192-2014_PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 6) ORDER 2014.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2172-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan\n\n(Kawalan Hasil Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (No. 6) 2014.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H2172-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pencetakan, pengimportan, penghasilan, penghasilan semula, penerbitan,\n\npenjualan, pengeluaran, pengelilingan, pengedaran atau pemilikan hasil penerbitan\n\nyang diperihalkan dalam Jadual yang mungkin memudaratkan ketenteraman awam dan\n\nmungkin menggemparkan fikiran orang ramai adalah dilarang secara mutlak di seluruh\n\nMalaysia.\n\nJADUAL\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\nPengarang/\n\nPenyusun\n\nPenerbit Pencetak Bahasa\n\nSultan Ismail Petra of\n\nKelantan, Dethroning of a\n\nMalay Ruler. An Authorised\n\nBiographical Account\n\nNarrated by Tengku\n\nMuhammad Fakhry to the\n\nAuthor\n\nProf Salleh\n\nBuang\n\n- - Inggeris\n\nDibuat 19 Jun 2014\n\n[KDN:PQ(S) 600-1/3 Jld. 2- (3); PN(PU2)417/XII]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMenteri Dalam Negeri\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS ACT 1984\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS\n\n(CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 6) ORDER 2014\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 7(1) of the Printing Presses and\n\nPublications Act 1984 [Act 301], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Printing Presses and Publications (Control of\n\nUndesirable Publications) (No. 6) Order 2014.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The printing, importation, production, reproduction, publishing, sale, issue,\n\ncirculation, distribution or possession of the publication described in the Schedule\n\nwhich is likely to be prejudicial to public order and likely to alarm public opinion is\n\nabsolutely prohibited throughout Malaysia.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nTitle of\n\nPublication\n\nAuthor/\n\nCompiler\n\nPublisher Printer Language\n\nSultan Ismail Petra of\n\nKelantan, Dethroning of a\n\nMalay Ruler. An Authorised\n\nBiographical Account\n\nNarrated by Tengku\n\nMuhammad Fakhry to the\n\nAuthor\n\nProf Salleh\n\nBuang\n\n- - English\n\nMade 19 June 2014\n\n[KDN:PQ(S) 600-1/3 Jld. 2- (3); PN(PU2)417/XII]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMinister of Home Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-5"};
  FT["MY-H2173"] = {"id":"MY-H2173","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 192/2015&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2015年联邦道路（私营管理）（通行费征收）（南巴生谷大道）（修正）（第2号）令","en":"FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (SOUTH KLANG VALLEY EXPRESSWAY) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2015","orig":"FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (SOUTH KLANG VALLEY EXPRESSWAY) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2015","ms":"Perintah Jalan Raya Persekutuan (Pengurusan Swasta) (Kutipan Tol) (Lebuh Raya Lembah Klang Selatan) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 2) 2015","vi":"Lệnh về Đường bộ liên bang (Quản lý tư nhân) (Thu phí đường bộ) (Đường cao tốc Thung lũng Klang Nam) (Sửa đổi) (số 2) năm 2015","th":"คำสั่งทางหลวงสหพันธ์ (การบริหารจัดการเอกชน) (การจัดเก็บค่าผ่านทาง) (ทางด่วนหุบเขากลังใต้) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2015","id":"Perintah Jalan Raya Federal (Pengelolaan Swasta) (Pemungutan Tol) (Jalan Tol Lembah Klang Selatan) (Perubahan) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2015"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA192","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2015","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2015_P.U.(A)192-2015_FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (SOUTH KLANG VALLEY EXPRESSWAY) (AMEND.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2173-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jalan-Jalan Persekutuan\n\n(Pengurusan Persendirian) (Pungutan Tol) (Lebuh Raya Lembah Klang Selatan)\n\n(Pindaan) (No. 2) 2015.\n\n (2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 September 2015.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H2173-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Jalan-Jalan Persekutuan (Pengurusan Persendirian) (Pungutan Tol)\n\n(Lebuh Raya Lembah Klang Selatan) 2013 [P.U. (A) 309/2013] dipinda dalam Jadual\n\nPertama dalam tajuk, dengan menggantikan perkataan \"31 OGOS 2015\" dengan\n\nperkataan \"31 DISEMBER 2015\".\n\nDibuat 26 Ogos 2015\n\n[KKR/PUU.110-1/7/27 Jld.2; PN(PU2)426/LIX]\n\nDATO' SERI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) ACT 1984\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS)\n\n(SOUTH KLANG VALLEY EXPRESSWAY) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2015\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 2 of\n\nthe Federal Roads (Private Management) Act 1984 [Act 306], the Minister makes the\n\nfollowing order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-5"};
  FT["MY-H2174"] = {"id":"MY-H2174","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 192/2016&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2016年印刷机与出版物（不良出版物管制）（第14号）令","en":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 14) ORDER 2016","orig":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 14) ORDER 2016","ms":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Kawalan Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (Bilangan 14) 2016","vi":"Lệnh về Máy in và ấn phẩm (Kiểm soát ấn phẩm không mong muốn) (số 14) năm 2016","th":"คำสั่งแท่นพิมพ์และสิ่งพิมพ์ (การควบคุมสิ่งพิมพ์ที่ไม่พึงประสงค์) (ฉบับที่ 14) ค.ศ. 2016","id":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Pengendalian Terbitan Tidak Diinginkan) (Nomor 14) Tahun 2016"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA192","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2016","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2016_P.U.(A)192-2016_PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 14) ORDER 2016.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2174-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan\n\n(Kawalan Hasil Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (No. 14) 2016.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H2174-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pencetakan, pengimportan, penghasilan, penghasilan semula, penerbitan,\n\npenjualan, pengeluaran, pengelilingan, pengedaran atau pemilikan hasil penerbitan\n\nyang diperihalkan dalam Jadual yang mungkin memudaratkan ketenteraman awam,\n\nyang mungkin menggemparkan fikiran orang ramai, yang mungkin memudaratkan\n\nkemoralan dan yang mungkin memudaratkan kepentingan negara adalah dilarang\n\nsecara mutlak di seluruh Malaysia.\n\nJADUAL\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\nPenyunting Penerbit Pencetak Bahasa\n\nIslam And\n\nHomosexuality\n\nVolume 1\n\nSamar Habib Praeger\n\n(An Imprint of)\n\nABC-CLIO\n\n130 Cremona Drive\n\nP.O Box 1911\n\nSanta Barbara\n\nCalifornia\n\n93116-1911\n\nPraeger\n\n(An Imprint of)\n\nABC-CLIO\n\n130 Cremona Drive\n\nP.O Box 1911\n\nSanta Barbara\n\nCalifornia\n\n93116-1911\n\nInggeris\n\nDibuat 18 April 2016\n\n[KDN:PQ(S)600- 2/3Jld.4(17); PN(PU2)417/XV]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMenteri Dalam Negeri\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS ACT 1984\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS\n\n(CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 14) ORDER 2016\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 7(1) of the\n\nPrinting Presses and Publications Act 1984 [Act 301], the Minister makes the following\n\norder:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Printing Presses and Publications (Control of\n\nUndesirable Publications) (No. 14) Order 2016.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The printing, importation, production, reproduction, publishing, sale, issue,\n\ncirculation, distribution or possession of the publication described in the Schedule\n\nwhich is likely to be prejudicial to public order, likely to alarm public opinion, likely to\n\nbe prejudicial to morality and likely to be prejudicial to national interest are absolutely\n\nprohibited throughout Malaysia.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nTitle of\n\nPublication\n\nEditor Publisher Printer Language\n\nIslam And\n\nHomosexuality\n\nVolume 1\n\nSamar Habib Praeger\n\n(An Imprint of)\n\nABC-CLIO\n\n130 Cremona Drive\n\nP.O Box 1911\n\nSanta Barbara\n\nCalifornia\n\n93116-1911\n\nPraeger\n\n(An Imprint of)\n\nABC-CLIO\n\n130 Cremona Drive\n\nP.O Box 1911\n\nSanta Barbara\n\nCalifornia\n\n93116-1911\n\nEnglish\n\nMade 18 April 2016\n\n[KDN:PQ(S)600- 2/3 Jld.4(17); PN(PU2)417/XV]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMinister of Home Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-5"};
  FT["MY-H2175"] = {"id":"MY-H2175","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 192/2018&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2018年马六甲马来西亚技术大学（注册成立）（迁址）令","en":"UNIVERSITI TEKNIKAL MALAYSIA MELAKA (INCORPORATION) (RELOCATION) ORDER 2018","orig":"UNIVERSITI TEKNIKAL MALAYSIA MELAKA (INCORPORATION) (RELOCATION) ORDER 2018","ms":"Perintah Universiti Teknikal Malaysia Melaka (Perbadanan) (Penempatan Semula) 2018","vi":"Lệnh về Đại học Kỹ thuật Malaysia Melaka (Thành lập) (Di dời) năm 2018","th":"คำสั่งมหาวิทยาลัยเทคนิคมาเลเซียมะละกา (การจดทะเบียนจัดตั้ง) (การย้ายที่ตั้ง) ค.ศ. 2018","id":"Perintah Universitas Teknikal Malaysia Melaka (Pendirian) (Relokasi) Tahun 2018"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA192","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2018","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2018_P.U.(A)192-2018_UNIVERSITI TEKNIKAL MALAYSIA MELAKA (INCORPORATION) (RELOCATION) ORDER 2018.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2175-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Universiti Teknikal Malaysia\n\nMelaka (Pemerbadanan) (Penempatan Semula) 2018.\n\nPenempatan semula"}},{"id":"MY-H2175-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Tapak Universiti Teknikal Malaysia Melaka sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam\n\nPerintah Universiti Teknikal Malaysia Melaka (Pemerbadanan) 2007 [P.U. (A) 43/2007]\n\nyang disiarkan dalam Warta pada 1 Februari 2007 ditempatkan semula ke\n\nHang Tuah Jaya, 76100 Durian Tunggal, Melaka berkuat kuasa mulai 9 April 2010.\n\nDibuat 16 Julai 2018\n\n[KPT.U.(S)100-1/2/1Jld.13; PN(PU2)75E/XIII]\n\nDengan Titah Perintah,\n\nDR. MASZLEE BIN MALIK\n\nMenteri Pendidikan\n\n[Akan dibentangkan dalam kedua-dua Majlis Parlimen menurut subseksyen 6(2)\n\nAkta Universiti dan Kolej Universiti 1971]\n\nUNIVERSITIES AND UNIVERSITY COLLEGES ACT 1971\n\nUNIVERSITI TEKNIKAL MALAYSIA MELAKA\n\n(INCORPORATION) (RELOCATION) ORDER 2018\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 6(1A) of the\n\nUniversities and University Colleges Act 1971 [Act 30], the Yang di-Pertuan Agong makes\n\nthe following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-5"};
  FT["MY-H2176"] = {"id":"MY-H2176","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 192/2019&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2019年道路交通（禁止使用道路）（联邦道路）（第2号）令","en":"ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 2) ORDER 2019","orig":"ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 2) ORDER 2019","ms":"Perintah Pengangkutan Jalan (Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Raya Persekutuan) (Bilangan 2) 2019","vi":"Lệnh về Vận tải đường bộ (Cấm sử dụng đường bộ) (Đường bộ liên bang) (số 2) năm 2019","th":"คำสั่งการขนส่งทางถนน (การห้ามใช้ถนน) (ทางหลวงสหพันธ์) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2019","id":"Perintah Angkutan Jalan (Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Raya Federal) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2019"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA192","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2019","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2019_P.U.(A)192-2019_ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 2) ORDER 2019.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2176-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Pengangkutan Jalan\n\n(Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Persekutuan) (No. 2) 2019.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 15 Julai 2019.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H2176-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pemanduan kenderaan di atas bahagian jalan yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1)\n\nJadual Pertama sebagaimana yang ditunjukkan dalam peta dalam Jadual Kedua,\n\nmelainkan di atas jalan arah yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2) Jadual Pertama, bagi\n\ntempoh yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (3) Jadual Pertama, dilarang.\n\nJADUAL PERTAMA\n\n(1)\n\nJalan yang baginya\n\nLarangan Terpakai\n\n (2)\n\nJalan Arah\n\n(3)\n\nTempoh Larangan\n\nSebahagian Laluan 58, Jalan\n\nBidor–Teluk Intan bermula\n\ndari seksyen 35.000 hingga\n\nseksyen 35.640, sebagaimana\n\nyang ditunjukkan dalam peta\n\ndalam Jadual Kedua\n\nKenderaan dari Bidor ke Teluk\n\nIntan dan sebaliknya hendaklah\n\nmenggunakan jalan lencongan\n\nsementara sebagaimana yang\n\nditunjukkan dalam peta dalam\n\nJadual Kedua\n\n15 Julai 2019\n\nhingga 1 Jun 2020\n\nJADUAL KEDUA\n\nDibuat 11 Julai 2019\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/15 Jld.6; PN(PU2)460/CIII]\n\nBARU BIAN\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nSg. Ayer\n\nKuning\n\nBidor\n\nSeksyen 35.640 Seksyen 35.000\n\nTeluk Intan 58 58\n\nPETUNJUK :\n\nJALAN YANG BAGINYA PERINTAH LARANGAN TERPAKAI\n\nJALAN LENCONGAN SEMENTARA\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD)\n\n(FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 2) ORDER 2019\n\nWHEREAS by P.U. (B) 324/2019 published on 27 June 2019, notice was given of the\n\nintention to make an order under section 70 of the Road Transport Act 1987 [Act 333]:\n\nAND WHEREAS no objection was received by the Minister of Works against the\n\nmaking of such order:\n\nNOW THEREFORE, in exercise of the powers conferred by section 70 of the Act,\n\nthe Minister of Works, after taking into consideration the matters referred to in\n\nsubsection 70(2) of the Act, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Road Transport\n\n(Prohibition of Use of Road) (Federal Roads) (No. 2) Order 2019.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 15 July 2019.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The driving of vehicles on the part of the road as specified in column (1) of the\n\nFirst Schedule as shown on the map in the Second Schedule, otherwise than on the\n\nroutes specified in column (2) of the First Schedule, for the period specified in\n\ncolumn (3) of the First Schedule, is prohibited.\n\nFIRST SCHEDULE\n\n(1)\n\nRoad to which\n\nProhibition Applies\n\n(2)\n\nRoutes\n\n(3)\n\nProhibition\n\nPeriod\n\nPart of Route 58, Bidor–Teluk\n\nIntan Road starting from\n\nsection 35.000 to section\n\n35.640, as shown on the map\n\nin the Second Schedule\n\nVehicles from Bidor to Teluk\n\nIntan and vice versa shall use\n\ntemporary diversion road as\n\nshown on the map in the\n\nSecond Schedule\n\n15 July 2019 to\n\n1 June 2020\n\nSECOND SCHEDULE\n\nMade 11 July 2019\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/15 Jld.6; PN(PU2)460/CIII]\n\nBARU BIAN\n\nMinister of Works\n\nSg. Ayer\n\nKuning\n\n Bidor\n\n Section 35.640 Section 35.000\n\nTeluk Intan 58\n\nLEGEND:\n\nROAD TO WHICH PROHIBITION ORDER IS APPLICABLE\n\nTEMPORARY DIVERSION ROAD"}}],"pack":"my-5"};
