  FT["MY-H245"] = {"id":"MY-H245","coverage":"partial","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-detail.php?act=29&lang=BI","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":12,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"1971年马来西亚国家体育理事会法","en":"NATIONAL SPORTS COUNCIL OF MALAYSIA ACT 1971","orig":"NATIONAL SPORTS COUNCIL OF MALAYSIA ACT 1971","vi":"Luật về Hội đồng Thể thao Quốc gia Malaysia năm 1971","th":"พระราชบัญญัติสภากีฬาแห่งชาติมาเลเซีย ค.ศ. 1971","id":"Undang-Undang Dewan Olahraga Nasional Malaysia Tahun 1971","ms":"Akta Majlis Sukan Negara Malaysia 1971"},"level":"law","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"ACT29","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"1971","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 20 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\1971_29_NATIONAL SPORTS COUNCIL OF MALAYSIA ACT 1971.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H245-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. This Act may be cited as the National Sports Council\nof Malaysia Act, 1971."}},{"id":"MY-H245-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires—\n\n\"Council\" means the National Sports Council of\nMalaysia established under section 3;\n\n\"Board\" means the Board of Management established\nunder section 6;\n\n\"Minister\" means the Minister charged with the responsi-\nbility for sports} o\n\n\"State Sports Council}? means the State Sports Council\nduly established under section 7.\nPART II\nCOUNCIL\n\nft\n|. Rana\n\nbo\n\nShort title.\n\nInterpreta-\ntion.\n\nA -An60/79\n\nA Ast 60\n\nol/&-A+bO\n\n3, There is hereby established a body by the name \"The The .\nNational Sports Council of Malaysia\" with power to Council\n\nacquire and hold movable or immovable property, and to\ndispose thereof or otherwise deal therewith.\n\n[Pt. II, S. 4]\n6                     Act 29\n\naaa  4, (1) The functions of the Council shall be—\n\nCoutell,     (a) to advise the Minister on matters pertaining to\nsports generally and to the proper and more\neffective implementation of the provisions of this\nAct;\n\n(b) to co-ordinate the activities in respect of sports\nconducted by government departments or govern-\nmental or non-governmental agencies;\n\n(c) to make recommendations to the Government as\nthe methods, measures and policies to be adopted\nto facilitate the development of sports, and where\napproved by Government, to implement and assist\nin the implementation thereof; and\n\n(d) generally to promote locally and internationally,\nand participate in, the development of sports in\nMalaysia.\n\n(2) The Council shall have power to do all things expe-\ndient or reasonably necessary or incidental to the discharge\nof its functions, and in particular, but without prejudice\nto the generality of the foregoing—\n\n(a) to conduct surveys and investigations in respect of\nsports;\n\n(b) to conduct and carry out feasibility studies for the\ndevelopment of sports;\n\n(c) to require government departments, and govern-\nmental and non-governmental agencies dealing in\nsports to submit reports regarding their activities;\n\n(d) to engage or assist in the development of sports,\nand in the provision or improvement Of sports\nfacilities within Malaysia and outside Malaysia,\nwhere international co-operation can stimulate the\n\nkap is)     development of{Malaysia;\n\n( A‘ Aboi  (e) with the approval of the Ministepy to enter into\n\n/                      equity participation in the development of sporting\n\n‘ie cooeultation wih enterprises, and the provision of sports facilities\n+e Minister of Finance and attractions;\n\nAA       (f) subjeet to the provision of any regulations made\n\nunder section 15, to regulate standards to be\nmaintained by sports enterprises;\n\nNATIONAL SPORTS COUNCIL OF MALAYSIA       7\n\n(g) to acquire, purchase, take on lease, hire, hold and\nenjoy movable and immovable property of every\ndescription and to convey, assign, surrender, and\nyield up, charge, mortgage, demise, reassign, transfer\nor otherwise dispose of, or deal with or to develop\nany movable or immovable property belonging to\nthe Council upon such terms as the Board deems\nfit;\n\n(h) to enter into any contract;\n\n(i) to receive, in consideration of the services rendered\nby it, such commission or payment as may be\nagreed upon;\n\n(j) to exercise all functions and powers and perform\nall duties which, under or by virtue of any other\nwritten law, may be vested or delegated to it; and\n\n(k) generally to do such acts as it thinks fit for the\npurpose of achieving any of the aforesaid objects.\n\n5, (1) The Council shall consist of members specified in\nsubsection (2).\n\n(2) The Chairman of the Council shall be the Minister\nand other members of the Council shall be appointed by\nthe Minister in the manner hereinafter specified, that is\nto say—\n\n(a) one representative shall be nominated by each State\nSports Council;\n\n(b) not less than five but not more than ten members\nshall be appointed from amongst persons who in\nthe opinion of the Minister can contribute to the\ndevelopment and promotion of sports; and\n\n(c) not less than three and not more than five members\nshall be appointed from Ministries which the\nMinister considers necessary to be represented.\n\n(3) The provisions of Part I of the First Schedule shall\napply to members of the Cou gil.\n\nPART III\nBOARD OF MANAGEMENT\n\n6, (1) The management of the affairs of the Council shall\nbe vested in a Board of Management which shall consist\nof the Chairman of the Council{and not less than six but\n\nnot more than ten members to      ppointed by the Minister < »\n\nin the manner specified in subsection (2),\n\n4-6]\n\nMembers\nof the\nCouncil.\n\nA\n\nBoard of\nManage-\nment.\n\nho shall ala,\nbe ema.\n3                ‘\n$ +he  |   a\n\nA+ AlLLO\n\n(Ph IV, S. 6-8)\n\nBstablish-\nment of\nState Sports\nCouncils.\n\nA Atbo/ Tq\n\nAppoint-\nment of\nDirector-\nGeneral\nand other\nservants of\nthe Board.\n\n8                                       Act 29\n\n(2) The members of the Board shall be appointed as\nfollows—\n\n(a) four members shall be persons who are members\nof the Council appointed under section 5;\n\n(b) one representative each of the Ministry of Culture,\nYouth and Sports and the Ministry of Finance\nrespectively; and\n\n(c) any other persons the Minister considers fit and\nproper persons to be members of the Board.\n\n(3) At any meeting of the Board one third of the total\nmembership of the Board shall, constitute a quorum.\n\n(4) The provisions of Part II of the First Schedule shall\napply to members of the Board.\n\npa\nPART IV\nSTATE SPORTS COUNCILS"}},{"id":"MY-H245-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"chapter":{"en":"PART IV"},"text":{"en":"7. (1) There shall be established in eyery State a State\nSports Council in respect of which the provisions of the\nSecond Schedule to this Act shall have effect.\n\n(2) The Minister may by order amend or vary the\nprovisions of the Second Schedule.\nY\nPART V\nADMINISTRATION"}},{"id":"MY-H245-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"chapter":{"en":"PART V"},"text":{"en":"8. (1) The Board may appoint a Director-General who shall\nbe responsible for the day to day administration and\nmanagement of the affairs of the Council and to perform\nsuch duties and exercise such powers as may be entrusted\nor delegated by the Board or the Chairman of the Board\nacting on behalf of the Board:\n\nProvided that the first Director-General immediately\nafter the coming into force of this Act shall be a person\nappointed by the Minister.\n\n(2) The Board may appoint such other officers and\nservants as it may consider necessary for the efficient\nconduct of the affairs of the Council.\n\n(3) The Director-General and other officers and servants\nof the Board shall be responsible to the Board.\n\n(4) The Director-General, officers and servants of the\nCouncil shall hold office for such period or periods, receive\nsuch salaries and allowances and be subject to such condi-\ntions of service as may be determined by the Board.\n\nNATIONAL SPORTS COUNCIL OF MALAYSIA       9\n\nPART VI\nFINANCE\n\n9, For the purpose of this Act, there is hereby established Fund of the\na National Sports Fund (hereinafter referred to as \"the Council.\nFund\") to be administered and controlled by the Board—\n\n(a) into which shall be paid—\n\n(i) such sums as may be provided from time to\ntime by Parliament;\n\n(ii) such sums as may from time to time be Kebon teres\nborrowed by the Boardffor the purpose of and' conditions\nmeeting any of its obligations or dischargingpPeovel by He\nany of its duties;                        INiaister is\n\nconsultation with\n\n(iii) all monies earned by the operation of any te mists of\nproject, scheme or enterprise financed from Firesce\nthe Fund;                                    A S#b6\n\n(iv) all monies earned or arising from any\nproperty, investment, mortgage, charges or\ndebentures acquired by or vested in the Board;\n\nand                                  Pee\n\nCi vay Re _ _                             — A -A+ed\n\n(v) all other sums or property which may in any\nmanner become payable to, or vested in, the\nBoard in respect of any matter incidental to\nits powers and duties;\n\n(b) out of which shall be defrayed—\n\n(i) all expenditure (including capital expenditure)\nincurred by the Board in carrying out its\nfunctions; and\n\n(ii) monies for the repayment of any loan made\nto the Board pursuant to its power to\nborrow."}},{"id":"MY-H245-A10","no":10,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 10"},"chapter":{"en":"PART VI"},"text":{"en":"10. The Board may, upon terms and conditions approved porrowing\nby the Ministeg borrow such sums as it may require for powers.   se:\n\n1            1       7           1               D Comer)   len\ncarrying out atf¥ of its functions under this Act.          = Wake Sinise"}},{"id":"MY-H245-A11","no":11,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 11"},"chapter":{"en":"PART VI"},"text":{"en":"11. The assets of the Board shall, insofar as they are not Investment. *°°\nrequired to be expended by the Board under this Act, be\n\ninvested in such manner as the Minister may approve:\n\nProvided that the Board shall not make any investment\nin securities issued or registered or other properties situated\noutside Malaysia except with the approval of the Minister\nof Finance.\n\n(Ph VE-VIT, S. 12-15)\n\nEstimates\nof Expen-\nditure.\n\nAccounts\nand audit.\n\n(ihe accounts of\n& audi teol w Mia\nAIK meng o4 +he\noa or cah Pinan -\nnel year anol\n\nwrth.     Such  pened\n\nAA HbO\n\nAnnual\nReport.\n\nRegula-\ntions,\n\n10                                      Act 29"}},{"id":"MY-H245-A12","no":12,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 12"},"chapter":{"en":"PART VI"},"text":{"en":"12. (1) The expenses of thé Board up to such amount as\nmay be authorised by the Minister for any one year shall\nbe defrayed out of the Fund.\n\n(2) Before the beginning of September of each year, the\nBoard shall submit to the Minister an estimate of the\nexpenses (including those for development projects) for the\nfollowing year in such form and with such particulars as\nthe Minister may require; and the Minister shall before\nthe beginning of November of that year notify the Board\nof the amount authorised for expenses generally or of the\namount authorised for each description of expenditure.\n\n(3) The Board may, at any time, submit to the Minister\na supplementary estimate for any one year and the Minister\nmay allow the whole or any part of the additional expen-\nditure included therein."}},{"id":"MY-H245-A13","no":13,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 13"},"chapter":{"en":"PART VI"},"text":{"en":"13. (1) The Board shall keep proper accounts and other\nrecords in respect of its operation and shall prepare state-\nments of accounts in respect of each financial year.\n\n(2) The accounts of the Board shall be audited annually\nby the Auditor-General or other auditors appointed by the\nBoard with the approval of the Minister.\n\nOe ths hon d hee ten minal the ee as\n.the -accounts—of_the—Board—have_been—audited, the Board\n\nshall cause a copy of the statement of accounts in such\nmanner as the Minister may require to be transmitted to\nthe Minister, together with a copy of any observations\nmade by the Auditor-General or other auditors appointed\nunder subsection (2) on any statement or on the accounts\nof the Board.\n\nPART VII\nGENERAL\n\n14, The Council shall not later than the 30th day of June\nof each year, cause to be made and transmitted to the\nMinister, a report dealing with the activities of the Council\nduring the preceding year and containing such information\nrelating to the proceedings and policy of the Council.\n\n15, The Minister may make such regulations as may be\nexpedient or necessary for prescribing anything required\nby this Act and for the better carrying out of the provisions\nof this Act.\n\npua\n\n[Pt. VII, S. 16-20]\n\nNATIONAL SPORTS COUNCIL OF MALAYSIA      1]"}},{"id":"MY-H245-A16","no":16,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 16"},"chapter":{"en":"PART VII"},"text":{"en":"16. (1) Except for the purposes of this Act or of any\ncriminal proceedings under this Act, no member, officer\nor servant of the Council shall disclose any information\nwith respect to any individual business, which has been\nobtained by him in the course of his duties and which is\nnot published in pursuance of this Act.\n\n(2) Any member knowingly contravening the provisions\nof subsection (1) shall be guilty of an offence and shall on\nconviction be liable to a fine not exceeding five thousand\ncollars or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding one\nyear."}},{"id":"MY-H245-A17","no":17,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 17"},"chapter":{"en":"PART VII"},"text":{"en":"17. The Director-General and any officer or servant of the\nCouncil appointed under section 8 shall be deemed to be\na public servant da the meaning of the Een Code, ia"}},{"id":"MY-H245-A18","no":18,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 18"},"chapter":{"en":"PART VII"},"text":{"en":"18. (1) No action, suit, prosecution or other proceedings\nshall be brought or instituted personally against any\nmember of the Council or Board or against the Director-\nGeneral, officer of the Council or Board or against any\ndirector, officer or servant appointed by the Board in\nrespect of any act done or statement made bona fide in\npursuance or execution or intended execution of this Act.\n\n(2) Where any person is exempted from liability by\nreason only of the provisions of this section, the Council\nis liable to the extent that it would be if such person were\na servant or agent of the Council.\n\n19, The Board may, by an instrument in writing, delegate\nto any person or body such of its duties as may be\nnecessary to be performed in or outside Malaysia:\n\nProvided that any such person or body shall have no\ncontrol over the Fund and shall act in all respects in\naccordance with the direction of the Board."}},{"id":"MY-H245-A20","no":20,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 20"},"chapter":{"en":"PART VII"},"text":{"en":"20. (1) The Minister may give to the Council or the Board\nsuch directions, not inconsistent with the provisions of this\nAct, as he may deem fit, as to the exercise and performance\nby the Council or the Board of its powers, duties and\nfunctions under this Act, and the Council or the Board\nshall give effect to all such directions.\n\nSecrecy and\npenalty.\n\nPenal Code.\n\nFUG. Le GS\nAIA A 4bo\n\nProtection\nagainst\nlegal\nproceedings.\n\nDelegation\nby the\nBoard.\n\nDirections\nby the\nMinister.\n\n(Pt. VII, S. 20-21, Ist Schedule]\n\n12                              Act 29\n\n(2) The Board shall furnish the Minister with such\ninformation with respect to its property and activities as\nhe may from time to time require.\n\nIneligibilny  21. (1) No person shall be eligible for employment as an\nmentas\" Officer or servant of the Council who has, directly or\nofficers os indirectly, by himself or his partner, any share or interest\n\nthe Council. in any contract with, for or on behalf of the Council.\n\n(2) Any officer or servant appointed by the Board who\nhas or acquires any such share or interest shall be liable in\nthe discretion of the Board to summary dismissal without\nnotice.\n\nFIRST SCHEDULE\n\nPART I\nTHE COUNCIL"}}],"pack":"my-5"};
  FT["MY-H2450"] = {"id":"MY-H2450","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 208/2021&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2021年石油（所得税）（豁免）令","en":"PETROLEUM (INCOME TAX) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2021","orig":"PETROLEUM (INCOME TAX) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2021","ms":"Perintah Petroleum (Cukai Pendapatan) (Pengecualian) 2021","vi":"Lệnh về Dầu khí (Thuế thu nhập) (Miễn trừ) năm 2021","th":"คำสั่งปิโตรเลียม (ภาษีเงินได้) (การยกเว้น) ค.ศ. 2021","id":"Perintah Perminyakan (Pajak Penghasilan) (Pembebasan) Tahun 2021"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA208","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2021_P.U.(A)208-2021_PETROLEUM (INCOME TAX) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2021.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2450-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Petroleum\n(Cukai Pendapatan) (Pengecualian) 2021.\n\n(2) Perintah ini hendaklah berkuat kuasa mulai tahun taksiran 2020.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H2450-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Menteri mengecualikan orang yang disebut dalam subperenggan (2) dalam\ntempoh asas bagi suatu tahun taksiran daripada peruntukan seksyen 49 A Akta\nberkenaan dengan pendapatan yang diperoleh daripada Blok PM3 Kawasan Perkiraan\nKomersial Malaysia-Vietnam.\n\n (2) Orang yang disebut dalam subperenggan (1) ialah—\n\n(a) Repsol Oil & Gas Malaysia Limited;\n\n(b) Repsol Oil & Gas Malaysia (PM3) Limited;\n\n(c) Petronas Carigali Sendirian Berhad; dan\n\n(d) Petrovietnam Exploration Production Corporation Limited.\n\n (3) Tiada apa -apa jua dalam subperenggan (1) boleh melepaskan atau\ndisifatkan telah melepaskan orang yang disebut dalam  subperenggan (2) daripada\nmematuhi apa -apa kehendak untuk  mengemukakan apa -apa penyata atau penyata\nakaun atau mengemukakan apa-apa maklumat lain di bawah Akta.\n\nDibuat 13 April 2021\n[MOF.TAX(R)700-2/1/35; PN(PU2)474/IV]\n\nTENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\nMenteri Kewangan\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 65 C(2)\nAkta Petroleum (Cukai Pendapatan) 1967]\nPETROLEUM (INCOME TAX) ACT 1967\n\nPETROLEUM (INCOME TAX) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 65C(1) of the\nPetroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967 [Act 543], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-5"};
  FT["MY-H2451"] = {"id":"MY-H2451","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 208/2022&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2022年联邦政府部长（第3号）（修正）（第2号）令","en":"MINISTERS OF THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT (NO. 3) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2022","orig":"MINISTERS OF THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT (NO. 3) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2022","ms":"Perintah Menteri Kerajaan Persekutuan (Bilangan 3) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 2) 2022","vi":"Lệnh về Các Bộ trưởng Chính phủ Liên bang (số 3) (Sửa đổi) (số 2) năm 2022","th":"คำสั่งรัฐมนตรีของรัฐบาลสหพันธ์ (ฉบับที่ 3) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2022","id":"Perintah Menteri Pemerintah Federal (Nomor 3) (Perubahan) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2022"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA208","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2022","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2022_P.U.(A)208-2022_MINISTERS OF THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT (NO. 3) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2022.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2451-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Menteri-Menteri\n\nKerajaan Persekutuan (No. 3) (Pindaan) (No. 2) 2022.\n\n(2) Perintah ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada 11 Mac 2022.\n\nPindaan Jadual"}},{"id":"MY-H2451-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Menteri-Menteri Kerajaan Persekutuan (No. 3) 2021 [P.U. (A) 383/2021]\n\ndipinda dalam Jadual berkenaan dengan Kementerian Pembangunan Usahawan dan\n\nKoperasi dalam teks bahasa Inggeris—\n\n(a) dengan menggantikan butiran \"Minister of Entrepreneur Development and\n\nCooperatives\" dalam ruang \"Style and Title/Date of Appointment\" dengan\n\nbutiran \"Minister of Entrepreneur and Cooperatives Development\";\n\n(b) dengan menggantikan butiran \"Deputy Minister of Entrepreneur\n\nDevelopment and Cooperatives\" dalam ruang \"Style and Title/Date of\n\nAppointment\" dengan butiran \"Deputy Minister of Entrepreneur and\n\nCooperatives Development\"; dan\n\n(c) dengan menggantikan butiran \"Ministry of Entrepreneur Development and\n\nCooperatives\" dalam ruang \"Department/Subject\" dengan butiran\n\n\"Ministry of Entrepreneur and Cooperatives Development\".\n\nDibuat 8 Jun 2022\n\n[BKPP.R.700-2/1/1 JLD. 11; PN(PU2)18/Jld. 38]\n\nDengan Titah Perintah\n\nTAN SRI DATO' SERI MOHD ZUKI BIN ALI\n\nSetiausaha Jemaah Menteri\n\nMINISTERIAL FUNCTIONS ACT 1969\n\nMINISTERS OF THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT (NO. 3)\n\n(AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2022\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 2 of the\n\nMinisterial Functions Act 1969 [Act 2], the Yang di-Pertuan Agong makes the\n\nfollowing order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-5"};
  FT["MY-H2452"] = {"id":"MY-H2452","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 208/2023&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2023年印花税（豁免）（第3号）令","en":"STAMP DUTY (REMISSION) (NO. 3) ORDER 2023","orig":"STAMP DUTY (REMISSION) (NO. 3) ORDER 2023","ms":"Perintah Duti Setem (Remisi) (Bilangan 3) 2023","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế tem (Giảm miễn) (số 3) năm 2023","th":"คำสั่งอากรแสตมป์ (การงดเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 3) ค.ศ. 2023","id":"Perintah Bea Meterai (Pembebasan) (Nomor 3) Tahun 2023"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA208","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2023","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2023_P.U.(A)208-2023_STAMP DUTY (REMISSION) (NO. 3) ORDER 2023.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2452-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Setem (Peremitan )\n(No. 3) 2023.\n\nPeremitan"}},{"id":"MY-H2452-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Menteri meremitkan duti setem di bawah subsubbutiran 31(a)\nJadual Pertama kepada Akta yang melebihi koson g perpuluhan satu peratus  daripada\nduti setem yang kena dibayar atas semua surat cara nota kontrak yang berhubungan\ndengan penjualan apa -apa syer atau stok yang disenaraikan di pasaran saham\nbagi bursa saham yang diluluskan di bawah subseksyen 8(2) Akta Pasaran Modal\ndan Perkhidmatan 2007 [Akta 671].\n\n (2) Menteri selanjutnya meremitkan duti setem yang kena dibayar selepas\nperemitan di bawah subperenggan 2(1) yang melebihi satu ribu ringgit.\n\n (3) Peremitan di bawah Perintah ini  hendaklah hanya terpakai ke pada\nsurat cara nota kontrak yang disempurnakan pada atau selepas  13 Julai 2023\ntetapi tidak lewat daripada 12 Julai 2028.\n\nPembatalan"}},{"id":"MY-H2452-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah Duti Setem (Peremitan) 2022 [P.U. (A) 112/2022] dibatalkan.\n\nDibuat 12 Julai 2023\n[MOF.TAX(S)700-1/3/11 JLD.5; LHDN.AY.A 600-12/1/7(29)-313; PN(PU2)159/JLD.37]\n\nANWAR BIN IBRAHIM\nMenteri Kewangan\nSTAMP ACT 1949\n\nSTAMP DUTY (REMISSION) (NO. 3) ORDER 2023\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 80(2) of the Stamp Act 1949 [Act 378],\nthe Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-5"};
  FT["MY-H2453"] = {"id":"MY-H2453","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 208/2024&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2024年所得税（豁免）（第4号）（修正）令","en":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 4) ORDER 2023 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024","orig":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 4) ORDER 2023 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024","ms":"Perintah Cukai Pendapatan (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 4) (Pindaan) 2024","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế thu nhập (Miễn trừ) (Số 4) (Sửa đổi) năm 2024","th":"คำสั่งภาษีเงินได้ (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 4) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2024","id":"Perintah Pajak Penghasilan (Pembebasan) (Nomor 4) (Perubahan) Tahun 2024"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA208","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2024","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2024_P.U.(A)208-2024_INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 4) ORDER 2023 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2453-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Cukai Pendapatan\n(Pengecualian) (No. 4) 2023 (Pindaan) 2024.\n\n (2) Perintah ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Januari 2023.\n\nPindaan perenggan 5"}},{"id":"MY-H2453-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Cukai Pendapatan (Pengecualian) (No. 4) 2023 [ P.U. (A) 382/2023],\nyang disebut \"Perintah ibu\" dalam Perintah ini, dipinda dalam subsubperenggan 5(2)(a)\ndengan menggantikan perkataan \"31 Disember 2022\" dengan perkataan \"31 Disember 2024\".\n\nPindaan perenggan 7"}},{"id":"MY-H2453-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perenggan 7 Perintah ibu dipinda dengan memotong subperenggan (3).\n\nDibuat 25 Julai 2024\n[Perb. MOF.TAX(S)700-1/3/73; LHDN.AY.A 600-12/1/7 (29)-349; PN(PU2)80/JLD.112]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\nMenteri Kewangan II\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan R akyat menurut subseksyen 127(4)\nAkta Cukai Pendapatan 1967]\n\nINCOME TAX ACT 1967\n\nINCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 4) ORDER 2023 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 127(3) (b)\nof the Income Tax Act 1967 [Act 53], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-5"};
  FT["MY-H2454"] = {"id":"MY-H2454","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 208/2025&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2025年贷款担保（法人团体）（税收与印花税豁免）（国家高等教育基金局）令","en":"LOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) (PERBADANAN TABUNG PENDIDIKAN TINGGI NASIONAL) ORDER 2025","orig":"LOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) (PERBADANAN TABUNG PENDIDIKAN TINGGI NASIONAL) ORDER 2025","ms":"Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Badan Korporat) (Remisi Cukai dan Duti Setem) (Perbadanan Tabung Pendidikan Tinggi Nasional) 2025","vi":"Lệnh về Bảo lãnh khoản vay (Pháp nhân) (Giảm miễn thuế và thuế tem) (Tổng công ty Quỹ Giáo dục Đại học Quốc gia) năm 2025","th":"คำสั่งการค้ำประกันเงินกู้ (นิติบุคคล) (การงดเว้นภาษีและอากรแสตมป์) (องค์การกองทุนอุดมศึกษาแห่งชาติ) ค.ศ. 2025","id":"Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Badan Hukum) (Pembebasan Pajak dan Bea Meterai) (Perbadanan Dana Pendidikan Tinggi Nasional) Tahun 2025"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA208","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2025","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2025_P.U.(A)208-2025_LOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) (PERBADANAN TABUNG PENDIDI.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2454-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman\n(Pertubuhan Perbadanan) (Peremitan Cukai dan Duti Setem) (Perbadanan Tabung\nPendidikan Tinggi Nasional) 2025.\n\nTafsiran"}},{"id":"MY-H2454-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Dalam Perintah ini—\n\n \"jaminan\" ertinya jaminan yang diberikan atau akan diberikan  oleh\nKerajaan Malaysia berhubung dengan Kemudahan Kredit dan Program Sukuk;\n\n \"Kemudahan Kredit\" ertinya pinjaman bersindiket atau dua hala,\natau kemudahan pembiayaan yang diperoleh atau akan diperoleh oleh\nPerbadanan Tabung Pendidikan Tinggi Nasional dengan amaun agregat prinsipal\ntidak melebihi  dua belas bilion satu ratus  lima juta ringgit (RM12,105,000,000.00)\ntermasuk nilai nominal agregat yang telah diperoleh di bawah Program Sukuk;\n\n \"Program Sukuk\" ertinya  Kertas K omersial Islam dan Nota Jangka\nSederhana Islam yang diterbitkan atau akan diterbitkan  oleh Perbadanan Tabung\nPendidikan Tinggi Nasional  menurut Program Sukuk  dengan nilai nominal agregat\ntidak melebihi  dua belas bilion satu ratus  lima juta ringgit (RM12,105,000,000.00)\ntermasuk amaun agregat prinsipal yang telah diperoleh di bawah Kemudahan Kredit.\n\nPeremitan cukai"}},{"id":"MY-H2454-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Apa-apa cukai yang kena dibayar di bawah Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967\n[Akta 53] oleh—\n\n(a) Perbadanan Tabung Pendidikan Tinggi Nasional, mana-mana pembiaya\nKemudahan Kredit atau pemegang  Program Sukuk berkenaan dengan\napa-apa wang yang kena dibayar di bawah apa -apa perjanjian, nota,\nsurat cara dan dokumen berhubung dengan Kemudahan Kredit ,\nProgram Sukuk dan jaminan; atau\n\n(b) mana-mana orang yang  apa-apa perjanjian, nota, surat cara dan\ndokumen berhubung dengan Kemudahan Kredit dan Program Sukuk\ndipindahkan atau diserahhakkan,\n\nhendaklah diremitkan sepenuhnya.\n\nPeremitan duti setem"}},{"id":"MY-H2454-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Apa-apa duti setem yang kena dibayar di bawah Akta Setem 1949 [ Akta 378 ]\nberkenaan dengan apa-apa perjanjian, nota, surat cara dan dokumen berhubung dengan\nKemudahan Kredit, Program Sukuk dan jaminan hendaklah diremitkan sepenuhnya.\n\nDibuat 4 Julai 2025\n[MOF.SID MOF.SID(S)700-14-2-11 Jld. 9 (3); PN(PU2)232/JLD.18]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH BIN AZIZAN\nMenteri Kewangan II\nLOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) ACT 1965\n\nLOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY)\n(PERBADANAN TABUNG PENDIDIKAN TINGGI NASIONAL) ORDER 2025\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 10(1) of\nthe Loans Guarantee (Bodies Corporate) Act 1965 [Act 96 ], the Minister makes\nthe following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-5"};
  FT["MY-H2455"] = {"id":"MY-H2455","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 208/2026&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2026年费用（护照与签证）（修正）令","en":"FEES (PASSPORTS AND VISAS) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2026","orig":"FEES (PASSPORTS AND VISAS) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2026","ms":"Perintah Fi (Pasport dan Visa) (Pindaan) 2026","vi":"Lệnh về Phí (Hộ chiếu và thị thực) (Sửa đổi) năm 2026","th":"คำสั่งค่าธรรมเนียม (หนังสือเดินทางและวีซ่า) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2026","id":"Perintah Biaya (Paspor dan Visa) (Perubahan) Tahun 2026"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA208","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2026","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2026_P.U.(A)208-2026_FEES (PASSPORTS AND VISAS) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2026.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2455-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Fi (Pasport dan Visa)\n\n(Pindaan) 2026.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 3 Jun 2026.\n\nPindaan perenggan 2"}},{"id":"MY-H2455-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Fi (Pasport dan Visa) 1967 [P.U. 189/1967] dipinda dalam\n\nperenggan 2—\n\n(a) dalam subbutiran I(c), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"studying abroad\"\n\ndengan perkataan \"studying for a degree programme abroad\";\n\n(b) dalam subbutiran I(ca), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"studying abroad\"\n\ndengan perkataan \"studying for a degree programme abroad\";\n\n(c) dengan memasukkan selepas subbutiran I(cb) yang dipotong subbutiran\n\nyang berikut:\n\nFEES PAYABLE\n\n_____________________________\n\nDescription In Cash In Revenue\n\nStamps\n\n\"(cc) Malaysia Passport (Valid for 10\n\nyears) except for—\n\nRM350.00 —\n\n(i) persons of the age of 60 years\n\nand above\n\n(ii) persons of the age of 18 years\n\nand above with disabilities\n\nregistered under section 24\n\nand having Kad OKU issued\n\nunder section 25 of the\n\nPersons with Disabilities\n\nAct 2008 [Act 685]\n\n(iii) any officer and staff of the\n\nImmigration Department\n\nof Malaysia\n\n(cd) Malaysia Passport (Valid for 10\n\nyears) for persons of the age\n\nof 60 years and above\n\nRM175.00 —\n\n(ce) Malaysia Passport (Valid for 10\n\nyears) for persons of the age of 18\n\nyears and above with disabilities\n\nregistered under section 24 and\n\nhaving Kad OKU issued under\n\nsection 25 of the Persons with\n\nDisabilities Act 2008\n\nGratis —\n\n(cf) Malaysia Passport (Valid for 10\n\nyears) for any officer and staff\n\nof the Immigration Department\n\nof Malaysia\n\nGratis —\n\n \";\n\n(d) dengan menggantikan subbutiran I(d) dengan subbutiran yang berikut:\n\nFEES PAYABLE\n\n_____________________________\n\nDescription In Cash In Revenue\n\nStamps\n\n\"(d) Replacement of Malaysia Passport\n\n(Valid for 5 years) for reason\n\nof loss or damage—\n\n(i) for the first replacement of—\n\n(A) Malaysia Passport for\n\npersons of the age\n\nof 13 years to 59 years\n\nRM400.00 —\n\n(B) Malaysia Passport for\n\npersons of the age\n\nof 60 years and above\n\nRM300.00 —\n\n(C) Malaysia Passport for\n\nchildren of the age\n\nof 12 years and below\n\nRM300.00 —\n\n(D) Malaysia Passport for\n\nstudents of the age\n\nof 21 years and below\n\nstudying for a degree\n\nprogramme abroad\n\nRM300.00 —\n\n(E) Malaysia Passport for\n\nhajj pilgrims\n\nRM300.00 —\n\n(F) Malaysia Passport for\n\npersons under 18\n\nyears with disabilities\n\nregistered under\n\nsection 24 and having\n\nKad OKU issued under\n\nsection 25 of the\n\nPersons with Disabilities\n\nAct 2008\n\nRM200.00 —\n\n(ii) for the second replacement\n\nof—\n\n(A) Malaysia Passport for\n\npersons of the age\n\nof 13 years to 59 years\n\nRM700.00 —\n\n(B) Malaysia Passport for\n\npersons of the age\n\nof 60 years and above\n\nRM600.00 —\n\n(C) Malaysia Passport for\n\nchildren of the age\n\nof 12 years and below\n\nRM600.00 —\n\n(D) Malaysia Passport for\n\nstudents of the age\n\nof 21 years and below\n\nstudying for a degree\n\nprogramme abroad\n\nRM600.00 —\n\n(E) Malaysia Passport for\n\nhajj pilgrims\n\nRM600.00 —\n\n(F) Malaysia Passport for\n\npersons under 18\n\nyears with disabilities\n\nregistered under\n\nsection 24 and having\n\nKad OKU issued under\n\nsection 25 of the\n\nPersonswithDisabilities\n\nAct 2008\n\nRM500.00 —\n\n(iii) for the third and subsequent\n\nreplacement of—\n\n(A) Malaysia Passport for\n\npersons of the age\n\nof 13 years to 59 years\n\nRM1,200.00 —\n\n(B) Malaysia Passport for\n\npersons of the age\n\nof 60 years and above\n\nRM1,100.00 —\n\n(C) Malaysia Passport for\n\nchildren of the age\n\nof 12 years and below\n\nRM1,100.00 —\n\n(D) Malaysia Passport for\n\nstudents of the age\n\nof 21 years and below\n\nstudying for a degree\n\nprogramme abroad\n\nRM1,100.00 —\n\n(E) Malaysia Passport for\n\nhajj pilgrims\n\nRM1,100.00 —\n\n(F) Malaysia Passport for\n\npersons under 18\n\nyears with disabilities\n\nregistered under\n\nsection 24 and having\n\nKad OKU issued under\n\nsection 25 of the\n\nPersonswith Disabilities\n\nAct 2008\n\nRM1,000.00\n\n—\n\n\"; dan\n\n(e) dengan memasukkan selepas subbutiran I(d) subbutiran yang berikut:\n\nFEES PAYABLE\n\n_____________________________\n\nDescription In Cash In Revenue\n\nStamps\n\n\"(da) Replacement of Malaysia Passport\n\n(Valid for 10 years) for reason\n\nof loss or damage—\n\n(i) for the first replacement of—\n\n(A) Malaysia Passport for\n\npersons of the age\n\nof 18 years to 59 years\n\nRM550.00 —\n\n(B) Malaysia Passport for\n\npersons of the age\n\nof 60 years and above\n\nRM375.00 —\n\n(C) Malaysia Passport for\n\npersons above 18\n\nRM200.00 —\n\nyears with disabilities\n\nregistered under\n\nsection 24 and having\n\nKad OKU issued under\n\nsection 25 of the\n\nPersons with Disabilities\n\nAct 2008\n\n(D) Malaysia Passport for\n\nany officer and staff\n\nof the Immigration\n\nDepartment of Malaysia\n\nRM200.00 —\n\n(ii) for the second replacement\n\nof—\n\n(A) Malaysia Passport for\n\npersons of the age\n\nof 18 years to 59 years\n\nRM850.00 —\n\n(B) Malaysia Passport for\n\npersons of the age\n\nof 60 years and above\n\nRM675.00 —\n\n(C) Malaysia Passport\n\nfor persons above 18\n\nyears with disabilities\n\nregistered under\n\nsection 24 and having\n\nKad OKU issued under\n\nsection 25 of the\n\nPersons with Disabilities\n\nAct 2008\n\nRM500.00 —\n\n(D) Malaysia Passport for\n\nany officer and staff\n\nof the Immigration\n\nDepartment of Malaysia\n\nRM500.00 —\n\n(iii) for the third and subsequent\n\nreplacement of—\n\n(A) Malaysia Passport for\n\npersons of the age\n\nof 18 years to 59 years\n\nRM1,350.00 —\n\n(B) Malaysia Passport for\n\npersons of the age\n\nof 60 years and above\n\nRM1,175.00 —\n\n(C) Malaysia Passport\n\nfor persons above 18\n\nyears with disabilities\n\nregistered under\n\nsection 24 and having\n\nKad OKU issued under\n\nsection 25 of the\n\nPersons with Disabilities\n\nAct 2008\n\nRM1,000.00 —\n\n(D) Malaysia Passport for\n\nany officer and staff\n\nof the Immigration\n\nDepartment of Malaysia\n\nRM1,000.00\n\n—\n\n\".\n\nDibuat 16 Februari 2026\n\n[KDN.IMN.S.600-1/3/8; PN(PU2)86/JLD.30]\n\nDengan Titah Perintah\n\nTAN SRI SHAMSUL AZRI BIN ABU BAKAR\n\nSetiausaha Jemaah Menteri\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut seksyen 4 Akta Fi 1951]\n\nFEES ACT 1951\n\nFEES (PASSPORTS AND VISAS) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2026\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 3 of the Fees Act 1951 [Act 209],\n\nthe Yang di-Pertuan Agong makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-5"};
  FT["MY-H2456"] = {"id":"MY-H2456","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 209/1971&status=PINDAAN","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"1949年依《职位名衔》第3条所作公告条例","en":"NOTIFICATION UNDER SECTION 3 OF THE TITLES OF OFFICE ORDINANCE 1949","orig":"NOTIFICATION UNDER SECTION 3 OF THE TITLES OF OFFICE ORDINANCE 1949","ms":"Ordinan Pemberitahuan menurut Seksyen 3 Nama Jawatan 1949","vi":"Pháp lệnh về Thông báo theo mục 3 về Chức danh năm 1949","th":"บทบัญญัติประกาศตามมาตรา 3 ว่าด้วยชื่อตำแหน่ง ค.ศ. 1949","id":"Peraturan Pengumuman menurut Pasal 3 tentang Nama Jabatan Tahun 1949"},"level":"decree","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA209","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"1971","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\1971_P.U.(A)209-1971_NOTIFICATION UNDER SECTION 3 OF THE TITLES OF OFFICE ORDINANCE 1949.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2456-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Kaedah? ini boleh-lah di-namakan Kaedah? Ejensi Persendirian Nama.\n(Pindaan), 1971."}},{"id":"MY-H2456-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Kaedah? Ejensi Persendirian, 1970 dengan ini di-pinda dengan Pindaan bagi\nmenggantikan sebutan? mengenai Ordinan No, 58 (Kuasa? Perlu) dal\nDharurat, 1970 yang terdapat dalam Borang B dan D dalam Jadual,     '\ndengan sebutan? mengenai Akta Ejensi Persendirian, 1971.\n\nDi-perbuat pada 4hb Jun, 1971.\n[KHEDN. Y. 62/22; P.N. (P.U2.) 56.1\n\nTun Dr ISMAIL AL-HAJ BIN DaTO' Haji ABDUL RAHMAN,\nMenteri Hal Ehwal Dalam Negeri\n\nPRIVATE AGENCIES ACT, 1971\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 18 of the Private Act 27.\nAgencies Act, 1971, the Minister hereby makes the following rules:"}}],"pack":"my-5"};
  FT["MY-H2457"] = {"id":"MY-H2457","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 209/2012&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2012年所得税（豁免）（第4号）令","en":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 4) ORDER 2012","orig":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 4) ORDER 2012","ms":"Perintah Cukai Pendapatan (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 4) 2012","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế thu nhập (Miễn trừ) (số 4) năm 2012","th":"คำสั่งภาษีเงินได้ (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 4) ค.ศ. 2012","id":"Perintah Pajak Penghasilan (Pembebasan) (Nomor 4) Tahun 2012"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA209","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2012","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2012_P.U.(A)209-2012_INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 4) ORDER 2012.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2457-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Cukai Pendapatan\n(Pengecualian)(No. 4) 2012.\n(2) Perintah ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada 11 Februari 2010.\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H2457-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Menteri mengecualikan daripada cukai apa -apa perolehan atau\nkeuntungan yang termasuk di bawah perenggan 4 (f) Akta yang diterima oleh bukan\npemastautin daripada suatu entiti Labuan.\n(2) Bagi maksud perenggan ini \"entiti Labuan\" mempunyai er ti yang sama\nyang diberikan kepadanya di bawah Akta Cukai Aktiviti Perniagaan Labuan 1990\n[Akta 445].\nKetidakpakaian"}},{"id":"MY-H2457-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Peruntukan seksyen 109F Akta tidak terpakai bagi pendapatan yang\ndikecualikan di bawah Perintah ini.\nPembatalan"}},{"id":"MY-H2457-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Perintah Cukai Pendapatan (No. 4) 2009 [P.U. (A) 389/2009] yang disiarkan pada\n5 November 2009 dibatalkan.\n\nDibuat 21 Jun 2012\n[Perb.(C)0.217(SJ.18)VOL.5(SK.8); LHDN 01/35/(S)/42/51/231-12; PN(PU2)80/LXIV]\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n[Akan di bentangkan di hadapan Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 127(4) Akta Cukai\nPendapatan 1967]\n\nINCOME TAX ACT 1967\nINCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 4) ORDER 2012\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 127(3)(b) of the Income Tax Act 1967\n[Act 53], the Minister makes the following order:\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-5"};
  FT["MY-H2458"] = {"id":"MY-H2458","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 209/2013&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2013年伊斯兰金融服务（资金最低金额或资产超过负债的盈余）（持牌人）令","en":"ISLAMIC FINANCIAL SERVICES (MINIMUM AMOUNT OF CAPITAL FUNDS OR SURPLUS OF ASSETS OVER LIABILITIES) (LICENSED PERSON) ORDER 2013","orig":"ISLAMIC FINANCIAL SERVICES (MINIMUM AMOUNT OF CAPITAL FUNDS OR SURPLUS OF ASSETS OVER LIABILITIES) (LICENSED PERSON) ORDER 2013","ms":"Perintah Perkhidmatan Kewangan Islam (Jumlah Minimum Dana Modal atau Lebihan Aset Melebihi Liabiliti) (Orang Berlesen) 2013","vi":"Lệnh về Dịch vụ tài chính Hồi giáo (Số tiền tối thiểu của quỹ vốn hoặc thặng dư tài sản so với nợ phải trả) (Người được cấp phép) năm 2013","th":"คำสั่งบริการการเงินอิสลาม (จำนวนเงินขั้นต่ำของกองทุนหรือส่วนเกินสินทรัพย์เหนือหนี้สิน) (ผู้ได้รับใบอนุญาต) ค.ศ. 2013","id":"Perintah Jasa Keuangan Syariah (Jumlah Minimum Dana Modal atau Surplus Aset atas Kewajiban) (Orang Berlisensi) Tahun 2013"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA209","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2013","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 5 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2013_P.U.(A)209-2013_ISLAMIC FINANCIAL SERVICES (MINIMUM AMOUNT OF CAPITAL FUNDS OR SURPLUS OF ASSETS OVER LIABILITI.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2458-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Perkhidmatan Kewangan\nIslam (Amaun Minimum Dana Modal  atau Lebihan Aset Berbanding Liabiliti )\n(Orang Berlesen) 2013.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 30 Jun 2013.\n\nPemakaian"}},{"id":"MY-H2458-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah ini terpakai bagi orang berlesen.\n\nTafsiran"}},{"id":"MY-H2458-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Dalam Perintah ini—\n\n \"pengendali takaful semula profesional asing berlesen\" ertinya seorang\npengendali takaful semula  yang diperbadankan di luar Malaysia yang diberi lesen di\nbawah seksyen 10 Akta untuk menjalankan perniagaan takaful semula sahaja;\n\n \"pengendali takaful semula profesional berlesen\" ertinya seorang  pengendali\ntakaful semula yang diperbadankan di Malaysia yang diberi lesen di bawah seksyen 10\nAkta untuk menjalankan perniagaan takaful semula sahaja.\n\nDana modal minimum"}},{"id":"MY-H2458-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Amaun minimum dana modal bagi orang berlesen yang merupakan suatu\nsyarikat hendaklah mengikut amaun yang ditentukan dalam Jadual 1.\n\nLebihan aset berbanding liabiliti minimum"}},{"id":"MY-H2458-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. Amaun minimum lebihan aset berbanding liabiliti  bagi orang berlesen yang\nmerupakan suatu cawangan yang ditubuhkan oleh suatu institusi asing di Malaysia\nhendaklah mengikut amaun yang ditentukan dalam Jadual 2.\n\nJADUAL 1\n[Perenggan 4]\n\nKategori Dana modal minimum\n(RM)\nBank Islam berlesen  300,000,000\nBank Islam antarabangsa berlesen 10,000,000\nPengendali takaful berlesen 100,000,000\nPengendali takaful antarabangsa berlesen 10,000,000\nPengendali takaful semula profesional\nberlesen\n100,000,000\n\nJADUAL 2\n[Perenggan 5]\n\nKategori Lebihan aset berbanding liabiliti minimum\n(RM)\nBank Islam antarabangsa berlesen 10,000,000\nPengendali takaful antarabangsa berlesen 10,000,000\nPengendali takaful semula profesional asing\nberlesen\n20,000,000\n\nDibuat 28 Jun 2013\n[KK/BPKA/K2/(S)/382/690/9/1 JLD. 4; PN(PU2)717]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n\nISLAMIC FINANCIAL SERVICES ACT 2013\n\nISLAMIC FINANCIAL SERVICES (MINIMUM AMOUNT OF CAPITAL FUNDS OR SURPLUS\nOF ASSETS OVER LIABILITIES) (LICENSED PERSON) ORDER 2013\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 12(1)  of the Islamic F inancial\nServices Act 2013 [Act 759], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-5"};
  FT["MY-H2459"] = {"id":"MY-H2459","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 209/2014&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2014年联邦道路（东海岸大道（第二期））（修正）令","en":"FEDERAL ROADS (EAST COAST EXPRESSWAY–PHASE 2) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2014","orig":"FEDERAL ROADS (EAST COAST EXPRESSWAY–PHASE 2) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2014","ms":"Perintah Jalan Raya Persekutuan (Lebuh Raya Pantai Timur Fasa 2) (Pindaan) 2014","vi":"Lệnh về Đường bộ liên bang (Đường cao tốc Bờ Đông - Giai đoạn 2) (Sửa đổi) năm 2014","th":"คำสั่งทางหลวงสหพันธ์ (ทางด่วนชายฝั่งตะวันออก ระยะที่ 2) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2014","id":"Perintah Jalan Raya Federal (Jalan Tol Pantai Timur Tahap 2) (Perubahan) Tahun 2014"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA209","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2014","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2014_P.U.(A)209-2014_FEDERAL ROADS (EAST COAST EXPRESSWAY-PHASE 2) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2014.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2459-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jalan Persekutuan\n\n(Lebuh Raya Pantai Timur-Fasa 2) (Pindaan) 2014.\n\n (2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 18 Julai 2014.\n\nPindaan perenggan 2"}},{"id":"MY-H2459-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Jalan Persekutuan (Lebuh Raya Pantai Timur–Fasa 2) 2014\n\n[P.U. (A) 1/2014], yang disebut \"Perintah ibu\" dalam Perintah ini, dipinda dalam\n\nperenggan 2 dengan menggantikan subperenggan (1) dengan subperenggan yang\n\nberikut:\n\n \"(1) Bahagian jalan yang dikenali sebagai Lebuh Raya Pantai Timur–Fasa 2\n\nyang bermula —\n\n(a) dari kilometer 250.620 di koordinat U+88993.651000,\n\nT+245032.711000 Grid Rectified Skew Orthomorphic (RSO)\n\nGeosentrik (GDM 2000) dan berakhir di kilometer 274.457\n\ndi koordinat U+111115.179000, T+243110.234000 Grid (RSO)\n\nGeosentrik (GDM 2000), termasuklah Persimpangan Bertingkat\n\nCheneh dan jalan-jalan sambungannya iaitu suatu jarak sepanjang\n\n23.837 kilometer; dan\n\n(b) dari kilometer 329.387 di koordinat U+158623.184142,\n\nT+251519.143657 Grid RSO Geosentrik (GDM 2000) dan berakhir\n\ndi kilometer 433.977 di koordinat U+243442.227735,\n\nT+213048.376897 Grid RSO Geosentrik (GDM 2000), termasuklah\n\nPersimpangan Bertingkat Paka, Persimpangan Bertingkat Kuala\n\nDungun, Persimpangan Bertingkat Bukit Besi, Persimpangan\n\nBertingkat Ajil, Persimpangan Jalan Telemung, Persimpangan\n\nBertingkat Telemung, Persimpangan Bertingkat Kuala Terengganu\n\ndan jalan-jalan sambungannya iaitu suatu jarak sepanjang 104.590\n\nkilometer,\n\ndiisytiharkan sebagai jalan Persekutuan.\".\n\nPenggantian peta"}},{"id":"MY-H2459-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan peta dalam Jadual dengan peta yang\n\nberikut:\n\nJADUAL\n\n[Subperenggan 2(2)]\n\nPETA LEBUH RAYA PANTAI TIMUR–FASA 2\n\nDibuat 14 Julai 2014\n\n[KKR.PUU. 110-1/7/3/2 (29); PN(PU2)391/XXVII]\n\nDATUK HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\n Menteri Kerja Raya\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut seksyen 4 Akta Jalan Persekutuan 1959]\n\n\".\n\n\"\n\nFEDERAL ROADS ACT 1959\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (EAST COAST EXPRESSWAY–PHASE 2) (AMENDMENT)\n\nORDER 2014\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 3 of the Federal Roads Act 1959\n\n[Act 376], the Minister, after consultation with the State Government of Terengganu,\n\nmakes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Federal Roads (East Coast\n\nExpressway–Phase 2) (Amendment) Order 2014.\n\n (2) This Order comes into operation on 18 July 2014.\n\nAmendment of paragraph 2\n\n2. The Federal Roads (East Coast Expressway–Phase 2) Order 2014\n\n[P.U. (A) 1/2014], which is referred to as the \"principal Order\" in this Order, is amended\n\nin paragraph 2 by substituting for subparagraph (1) the following subparagraph:\n\n\"(1) The part of the road known as the East Coast Expressway–Phase 2\n\ncommencing—\n\n(a) from kilometre 250.620 at coordinates N+88993.651000,\n\nE+245032.711000 Rectified Skew Orthomorphic (RSO) Geocentric\n\n(GDM 2000) Grid and ending at kilometre 274.457 at coordinates\n\nN+111115.179000, E+243110.234000 (RSO) Geocentric (GDM 2000)\n\nGrid, including Cheneh Interchange and its link roads being a\n\ndistance of 23.837 kilometres; and\n\n(b) from kilometre 329.387 at coordinates N+158623.184142,\n\nE+251519.143657 RSO Geocentric (GDM 2000) Grid and ending\n\nat kilometre 433.977 at coordinates N+243442.227735,\n\nE+213048.376897 RSO Geocentric (GDM 2000) Grid, including\n\nPaka Interchange, Kuala Dungun Interchange, Bukit Besi\n\nInterchange, Ajil Interchange, Telemung Road Junction, Telemung\n\nInterchange, Kuala Terengganu Interchange and its link roads\n\nbeing a distance of 104.590 kilometres,\n\nis declared to be a Federal road.\".\n\nSubstitution of map\n\n3. The principal Order is amended by substituting for the map in the Schedule the\n\nfollowing map:\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n[Subparagraph 2(2)]\n\nMAP OF EAST COAST EXPRESSWAY–PHASE 2\n\nMade 14 July 2014\n\n[KKR.PUU. 110-1/7/3/2 (29); PN(PU2)391/XXVII]\n\nDATUK HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\n Minister of Works\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to section 4 of the Federal Roads Act 1959]\n\n\".\n\n\""}}],"pack":"my-5"};
  FT["MY-H246"] = {"id":"MY-H246","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-detail.php?act=2&lang=BI","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"1969年部长职能法","en":"MINISTERIAL FUNCTIONS ACT 1969","orig":"MINISTERIAL FUNCTIONS ACT 1969","vi":"Luật về Chức năng của bộ trưởng năm 1969","th":"พระราชบัญญัติหน้าที่ของรัฐมนตรี ค.ศ. 1969","id":"Undang-Undang Fungsi Menteri Tahun 1969","ms":"Akta Fungsi Menteri 1969"},"level":"law","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"ACT2","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"1969","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 5 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\1969_2_MINISTERIAL FUNCTIONS ACT 1969.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H246-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. This Act may be cited as the Ministerial Functions Act,"}},{"id":"MY-H246-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. (1) The Yang di-Pertuan Agong may by order notify in\nthe Gazette—\n\n(a) that a Minister has been conferred with any\nfunctions or has been charged with any responsi-\nbility in réspect of a particular department or\nsubject or that any transfer, to any other Minister,\nof any of the functions or responsibility referred\nto has been made;\n\n(b) that any style or title has been assigned to any\nMinister (except the Prime Minister) or that any\nchange in any style and title referred to has been\nmade.\n\n(2) An order made by the Yang di-Pertuan Agong under\nthis section—\n\n(a) may provide for the transfer of any property, rights\nor liabilities held, enjoyed or incurred by any\nMinister in connection with any functions con-\nferred or transferred; and\n\n(b) may contain such other provisions as may be\nnecessary or expedient for the purpose of giving\neffect to the order.\n\nShort title.\n\nFunctions,\nstyles and\ntitles of\nMinisters.\n\n[S. 3-5]\n\nEffect of\ntransfer of\nfunctions\nand change\nof style\nand title,\n\nReference\nin written\nlaws.\n\nRepeal and\nsaving.\n\n15 of 1951.\n\n4              Act 2"}},{"id":"MY-H246-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"en":"3. Where an order is made by the Yang di-Pertuan Agong\nunder section 2 anything commenced, or done before the\norder came into force by or under the authority of the\nMinister whose functions and responsibility have been trans-\nferred or whose style or title is changed may be continued\nor completed by that Minister."}},{"id":"MY-H246-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"en":"4. Any reference in any written law or in any instrument,\ncontract or legal proceedings to any Minister as such by the\nstyle or title of his office shall unless the context otherwise\nrequires, be construed as a reference to the Minister for the\ntime being conferred with the functions or charged with the\nresponsibility or to the Minister for the time being assigned\nwith such style or title."}},{"id":"MY-H246-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"en":"5. The Ministers of the Federal Government (Transfer of\nFunctions) Ordinance, 1951, is hereby repealed :\n\nProvided that orders made under that Ordinance or any\nother written law relating to the transfer of functions of a\nMinister or public officer which were in force immediately\nbefore the commencement of this Act shall be deemed to\nhave been made under this Act and shall remain in force,\nand may be amended or revoked, accordingly.\n\nKUALA LUMPUR\nDI-CHETAK OLEH PENCHETAK KERAJAAN DAN DI-TERBITKAN DENGAN PERENTAH PADA\n27HB FEBRUARI, 1969\n\nHarga: 20 sen"}}],"pack":"my-5"};
  FT["MY-H2460"] = {"id":"MY-H2460","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 209/2015&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2015年陆路公共交通〔商用车辆执照局（车费率）（修正）（第3号）〕条例","en":"LAND PUBLIC TRANSPORT [COMMERCIAL VEHICLES LICENSING BOARD (RATES OF FARE) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 3) RULES 2015] REGULATIONS 2015","orig":"LAND PUBLIC TRANSPORT [COMMERCIAL VEHICLES LICENSING BOARD (RATES OF FARE) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 3) RULES 2015] REGULATIONS 2015","ms":"Peraturan Pengangkutan Awam Darat [Lembaga Pelesenan Kenderaan Perdagangan (Kadar Tambang) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 3)] 2015","vi":"Quy định về Vận tải công cộng đường bộ [Ủy ban Cấp phép Xe Thương mại (Biểu giá cước) (Sửa đổi) (Số 3)] năm 2015","th":"ข้อบังคับการขนส่งสาธารณะทางบก [คณะกรรมการออกใบอนุญาตยานพาหนะพาณิชย์ (อัตราค่าโดยสาร) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 3)] ค.ศ. 2015","id":"Peraturan Angkutan Umum Darat [Dewan Perizinan Kendaraan Niaga (Tarif Angkutan) (Perubahan) (Nomor 3)] Tahun 2015"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA209","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2015","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2015_P.U.(A)209-2015_LAND PUBLIC TRANSPORT [COMMERCIAL VEHICLES LICENSING BOARD (RATES OF FARE) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 3).txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2460-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nPengangkutan Awam Darat [Kaedah-Kaedah Lembaga Pelesenan Kenderaan\n\nPerdagangan (Kadar Tambang) (Pindaan) (No. 3) 2015] 2015.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H2460-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Kaedah-Kaedah Lembaga Pelesenan Kenderaan Perdagangan\n\n(Kadar Tambang) 2000 [P.U. (A) 242/2000] dipinda dalam Jadual Pertama di bawah\n\nkepala \"BAHAGIAN 1 ― SEMENANJUNG MALAYSIA\" dengan memasukkan\n\nselepas perenggan 1B perenggan yang berikut:\n\n \"1C. Bas Rapid Transit (BRT) di bawah kelas lesen Bas Henti-Henti (bagi kawasan\n\nKuala Lumpur dan sekitarnya)\n\n(a) kadar tambang permulaan yang tetap sebanyak 90 sen dikenakan ke\n\natas setiap penumpang bagi keseluruhan perjalanan\n\nJarak Kadar Tambang (untuk\n\nsetiap kilometer bagi setiap\n\npenumpang)\n\n (b) (i) tidak lebih daripada 6 kilometer tidak lebih daripada\n\n0.815 sen digenapkan\n\nkepada nilai 10 sen yang\n\nterdekat\n\n(ii) lebih daripada 6 kilometer\n\ntetapi tidak lebih daripada\n\n12 kilometer\n\ntidak lebih daripada\n\n0.513 sen digenapkan\n\nkepada nilai 10 sen yang\n\nterdekat\n\n(iii) lebih daripada 12 kilometer\n\ntetapi tidak lebih daripada\n\n18 kilometer\n\ntidak lebih daripada\n\n0.421 sen digenapkan\n\nkepada nilai 10 sen yang\n\nterdekat\n\n(iv) lebih daripada 18 kilometer\n\ntetapi tidak lebih daripada\n\n24 kilometer\n\ntidak lebih daripada\n\n0.282 sen digenapkan\n\nkepada nilai 10 sen yang\n\nterdekat\n\n(v) lebih daripada 24 kilometer tidak lebih daripada\n\n0.212 sen digenapkan\n\nkepada nilai 10 sen yang\n\nterdekat\n\n(c) pemegang kad konsesi (pelajar, orang\n\nkurang upaya dan warga tua 60 tahun\n\ndan ke atas)\n\ntidak lebih daripada\n\n1/2 harga daripada kadar\n\nyang ditetapkan digenapkan\n\nkepada nilai 10 sen yang\n\nterdekat\".\n\nDibuat 1 September 2015\n\n[JPM.120-1/39 Jld.18(49); PN(PU2)692/III]\n\nDATO' SRI MOHD NAJIB BIN TUN ABDUL RAZAK\n\nPerdana Menteri\n\nLAND PUBLIC TRANSPORT ACT 2010\n\nLAND PUBLIC TRANSPORT [COMMERCIAL VEHICLES LICENSING BOARD\n\n(RATES OF FARE) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 3) RULES 2015] REGULATIONS 2015\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 252(1)(t) of\n\nthe Land Public Transport Act 2010 [Act 715], the Minister, on the recommendation of\n\nthe Commission, makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-5"};
  FT["MY-H2461"] = {"id":"MY-H2461","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 209/2017&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":null,"en":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 14) ORDER 20","orig":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 14) ORDER 20","ms":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 14) ORDER 20"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA209","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2017","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2017_P.U.(A)209-2017_PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 14) ORDER 20.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2461-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan\n\n(Kawalan Hasil Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (No. 14) 2017.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H2461-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pencetakan, pengimportan, penghasilan, penghasilan semula, penerbitan,\n\npenjualan, pengeluaran, pengelilingan, pengedaran atau pemilikan hasil penerbitan\n\nyang diperihalkan dalam Jadual yang mungkin memudaratkan ketenteraman awam,\n\nyang mungkin menggemparkan fikiran orang ramai dan yang mungkin memudaratkan\n\nkepentingan awam adalah dilarang secara mutlak di seluruh Malaysia.\n\nJADUAL\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\nPengarang/\n\nPenterjemah\n\nPenerbit Pencetak Bahasa\n\n1. Imam Mahdi Di\n\nAmbang Pintu:\n\nKedatangan yang\n\nDitunggu-tunggu\n\nJilid 1\n\nMuhammad\n\nIsa Dawud/\n\nDr.\n\nSyamsuddin\n\nAli Nasution\n\nPustaka\n\nSyuhada\n\nNo. 1074(6),\n\nJalan Sentul\n\nPasar, 51100\n\nKuala Lumpur\n\n- Melayu\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\nPengarang/\n\nPenterjemah\n\nPenerbit Pencetak Bahasa\n\n2. Imam Mahdi Di\n\nAmbang Pintu:\n\nKedatangan Yang\n\nDitunggu-tunggu\n\nJilid 2\n\nMuhammad\n\nIsa Dawud/\n\nDr.\n\nSyamsuddin\n\nAli Nasution\n\nPustaka\n\nSyuhada\n\nNo. 1074(6),\n\nJalan Sentul\n\nPasar, 51100\n\nKuala Lumpur\n\n- Melayu\n\nDibuat 14 Jun 2017\n\n[KDN.PQ.S.600-16/15/33; PN(PU2)417/XXI]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMenteri Dalam Negeri\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS ACT 1984\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS\n\n(CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 14) ORDER 2017\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 7(1)\n\nof the Printing Presses and Publications Act 1984 [Act 301], the Minister makes the\n\nfollowing order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Printing Presses and Publications\n\n(Control of Undesirable Publications) (No. 14) Order 2017.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The printing, importation, production, reproduction, publishing, sale, issue,\n\ncirculation, distribution or possession of the publication described in the Schedule\n\nwhich is likely to be prejudicial to public order, likely to alarm public opinion and likely\n\nto be prejudicial to public interest is absolutely prohibited throughout Malaysia.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nTitle of\n\nPublication\n\nAuthor/\n\nTranslator\n\nPublisher Printer Language\n\n1. Imam Mahdi Di\n\nAmbang Pintu:\n\nKedatangan yang\n\nDitunggu-tunggu\n\nJilid 1\n\nMuhammad\n\nIsa Dawud/\n\nDr.\n\nSyamsuddin\n\nAli Nasution\n\nPustaka\n\nSyuhada\n\nNo. 1074(6),\n\nJalan Sentul\n\nPasar, 51100\n\nKuala Lumpur\n\n- Malay\n\nTitle of\n\nPublication\n\nAuthor/\n\nTranslator\n\nPublisher Printer Language\n\n2. Imam Mahdi Di\n\nAmbang Pintu:\n\nKedatangan Yang\n\nDitunggu-tunggu\n\nJilid 2\n\nMuhammad\n\nIsa Dawud/\n\nDr.\n\nSyamsuddin\n\nAli Nasution\n\nPustaka\n\nSyuhada\n\nNo. 1074(6),\n\nJalan Sentul\n\nPasar, 51100\n\nKuala Lumpur\n\n- Malay\n\nMade 14 June 2017\n\n[KDN.PQ.S.600-16/15/33; PN(PU2)417/XXI]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMinister of Home Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-5"};
  FT["MY-H2462"] = {"id":"MY-H2462","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 209/2018&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2018年销售税（应税货物销售总额）令","en":"SALES TAX (TOTAL SALE VALUE OF TAXABLE GOODS) ORDER 2018","orig":"SALES TAX (TOTAL SALE VALUE OF TAXABLE GOODS) ORDER 2018","ms":"Perintah Cukai Jualan (Jumlah Nilai Jualan Barang Bercukai) 2018","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế bán hàng (Tổng giá trị bán hàng hóa chịu thuế) năm 2018","th":"คำสั่งภาษีขาย (มูลค่าการขายรวมของสินค้าที่ต้องเสียภาษี) ค.ศ. 2018","id":"Perintah Pajak Penjualan (Total Nilai Penjualan Barang Kena Pajak) Tahun 2018"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA209","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2018","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2018_P.U.(A)209-2018_SALES TAX (TOTAL SALE VALUE OF TAXABLE GOODS) ORDER 2018.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2462-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Cukai Jualan\n(Jumlah Nilai Jualan Barang Bercukai) 2018.\n\n (2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 September 2018.\n\nJumlah nilai jualan barang bercukai bagi pendaftaran"}},{"id":"MY-H2462-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Jumlah nilai jualan barang bercukai bagi maksud pen daftaran mana -mana\npengilang di bawah subseksyen 12(1) Akta adalah sebanyak lima ratus ribu ringgit.\n\nDibuat 28 Ogos 2018\n[SULIT .KE.HT(96) 009/28; Perb.R0.3865/365/1Jld. (SK.8); PN(PU2)751]\n\nLIM GUAN ENG\nMenteri Kewangan\n\nSALES TAX ACT 2018\n\nSALES TAX (TOTAL SALE VALUE OF TAXABLE GOODS) ORDER 2018\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 12(1) of the\nSales Tax Act 2018 [Act 806], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-5"};
